{"seq":3,"slug":"leaderless-quorum","title":"无主复制与法定人数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/leaderless-quorum","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"无主复制与法定人数\">无主复制与法定人数</h1><p>主从和多主都有「主」的概念，意味着总有某个节点的故障需要切换、需要选举。Amazon Dynamo 论文提出了一个激进的替代方案：干脆取消「主」。在无主拓扑里，没有谁是主库，客户端（或代理）直接把读写发给多个副本，靠「读写涉及的节点集合必然重叠」这一数学性质，来保证读得到足够新的数据。这种设计把「单点故障」从架构里彻底抹除，换来了极高的写可用性——代价是把一致性的复杂度从「选主」转移到了「每次读写都要凑齐法定人数」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无主（leaderless）拓扑中，每条数据复制到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点。写入时同时发往多个副本，等到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个确认即算成功；读取时同时向多个副本发起，等到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个响应即返回。只要满足法定人数条件，读集合与写集合必然有交集，从而读到最新写。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[客户端写] --&gt; N1[副本 1 OK]&#10;  C --&gt; N2[副本 2 OK]&#10;  C --&gt; N3[副本 3 慢/挂]&#10;  N1 --&gt; Q[收到 W=2 确认&lt;br/&gt;写成功]&#10;  N2 --&gt; Q&#10;  RC[客户端读] --&gt; N1&#10;  RC --&gt; N3&#10;  N1 --&gt; RQ[收到 R=2 响应&lt;br/&gt;取最新版本]&#10;  N3 --&gt; RQ&#10;  RQ --&gt; RR[读修复&lt;br/&gt;把旧副本补新]\">graph TD\n  C[客户端写] --&gt; N1[副本 1 OK]\n  C --&gt; N2[副本 2 OK]\n  C --&gt; N3[副本 3 慢/挂]\n  N1 --&gt; Q[收到 W=2 确认&lt;br/&gt;写成功]\n  N2 --&gt; Q\n  RC[客户端读] --&gt; N1\n  RC --&gt; N3\n  N1 --&gt; RQ[收到 R=2 响应&lt;br/&gt;取最新版本]\n  N3 --&gt; RQ\n  RQ --&gt; RR[读修复&lt;br/&gt;把旧副本补新]</pre><p>法定人数的核心不等式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W + R &gt; N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它保证读节点集合与写节点集合至少有一个共同节点，这个交集节点持有最新数据。只要读取时按版本取最新（用版本号或逻辑时钟判断），就能读到最近一次成功写入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=N, R=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>写全部、读一个</td>\n<td>强（写慢）</td>\n<td>读高写低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=1, R=N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>写一个、读全部</td>\n<td>强（读慢）</td>\n<td>写高读低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=R=\\lceil (N+1)/2 \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多数派读写</td>\n<td>强且均衡</td>\n<td>均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W+R \\le N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不满足法定人数</td>\n<td>仅最终一致</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"法定人数为什么有效\">法定人数为什么有效</h2><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 想象成三个抽屉。写入时你往任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个抽屉放最新值，读取时你打开任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个抽屉。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2+2 &gt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，你打开的两个抽屉里<strong>至少有一个</strong>是刚被写过的——鸽笼原理保证交集非空。于是只要在读到的多个版本里挑最新的，就拿到了最新值。</p>\n<p>这个「挑最新」的动作依赖能比较版本先后。无主系统不依赖物理时钟（会漂移），而用逻辑时钟/版本向量判断哪个版本更新、或两个版本是否「并发」（无法比较先后）。并发版本意味着冲突，处理方式见 <a href=\"../foundations/replication-consistency\">复制一致性模型</a> 与 <a href=\"../availability/conflict-resolution\">写冲突解决</a>。</p>\n<p>Cassandra 与 ScyllaDB 是无主法定人数的代表，其一致性级别正是 Dynamo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R+W&gt;N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 机制的实现：QUORUM 级别要求多数副本确认（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时需 2 个），读写都用 QUORUM 即保证交集、读到最新写（来源：cassandra.apache.org/doc Dynamo；docs.scylladb.com Consistency Levels）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"修复机制-副本如何追上\">修复机制：副本如何追上</h2><p>无主没有后台的日志流来同步副本，落后的副本靠两种机制追平：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读修复（read repair）</strong>：读请求发现某副本返回了旧值，就顺手把最新值写回那个副本。这让被频繁读的数据自动保持新鲜，但冷数据可能长期不被修复。</li>\n<li><strong>反熵（anti-entropy）/ 提示移交（hinted handoff）</strong>：后台进程持续比对副本差异并补齐；写入时若目标副本暂时不可达，协调者先把该写「提示」暂存，待其恢复再移交。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这两者合起来，让无主系统在没有主导日志流的情况下仍能达成 <a href=\"../foundations/replication-consistency\">复制一致性模型</a> 里说的最终收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨地域的法定人数变体\">跨地域的法定人数变体</h2><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本分散到三个地域，标准 QUORUM 要求 2 个确认——其中至少一个可能跨地域，写延迟立刻被跨洋 RTT 拖垮。为此 Cassandra/ScyllaDB 提供本地化变体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LOCAL_QUORUM</strong>：只要求请求所在数据中心内的多数副本确认，避免跨地域往返，又在本地保持强一致（来源：docs.datastax.com Configuring Consistency）。</li>\n<li><strong>EACH_QUORUM</strong>：要求每个数据中心都达成法定人数（仅写支持），用于必须全球一致的场景，代价是延迟最高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套本地/全局法定人数的取舍是 <a href=\"../operations/geo-distribution\">跨地域容灾</a> 的关键工具，让系统在「就近低延迟」和「全球强一致」之间精细调档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景\">适用场景</h2><p>无主适合写吞吐高、要求极高写可用、能容忍最终一致、且天然跨地域的工作负载：时序数据、消息流、IoT 写入、用户行为事件、购物车这类「宁可偶尔合并冲突也不能拒绝写」的场景。它把高可用做到了极致——没有主库故障、没有 <a href=\"../availability/failover-election\">故障切换与选主</a> 的停机窗口，单节点挂了集群照常读写。</p>\n<p>它的边界是：需要严格强一致或复杂事务时，无主很别扭（虽有轻量级事务但代价高）；调对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/W/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与冲突处理需要团队真正理解法定人数，否则容易在「以为强一致实则最终一致」上栽跟头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>无主拓扑取消「主」的概念，客户端直接读写多个副本，靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W+R&gt;N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 保证读写集合重叠、读到最新写。</li>\n<li>法定人数不等式由鸽笼原理保证交集非空；读到多版本时按逻辑时钟取最新、识别并发冲突。</li>\n<li>Cassandra/ScyllaDB 是代表，QUORUM 级别实现 Dynamo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R+W&gt;N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 机制。</li>\n<li>落后副本靠读修复、反熵、提示移交追平，无需主导日志流即可最终收敛。</li>\n<li>LOCAL_QUORUM/EACH_QUORUM 让法定人数适配跨地域，在就近延迟与全球一致间调档。</li>\n<li>适合高写吞吐、极高写可用、可容忍最终一致的跨地域负载；需强一致或复杂事务时不适用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无主复制与法定人数","id":"无主复制与法定人数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"法定人数为什么有效","id":"法定人数为什么有效"},{"level":2,"text":"修复机制：副本如何追上","id":"修复机制-副本如何追上"},{"level":2,"text":"跨地域的法定人数变体","id":"跨地域的法定人数变体"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景","id":"适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/multi-leader"},"next":{"title":"故障切换与选主","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/failover-election"}}